The word is "Elbereth" -- he was the fairest of the elves, and his name
drives away all non-human (and elven, I think) creatures, who cannot
attack you on that space.  A magic marker is useful for writing it
(use the (E)ngrave command), and so is a wand of fire.  Weapons will
dull if you use them to scratch it into the floor, and it takes a while,
during which the monsters will beat on you.  Look a few messages back
for a more complete description; I forget who posted it.

I hope you're not playing NH3.0, because the difficulty is such that
you should be an expert nethacker to even get to level 5 on the game.

